WEBVTT

00:14:29.034 --> 00:14:32.111
boljet će jako.

00:14:33.007 --> 00:14:35.077
To su mnogi razlozi

00:14:35.077 --> 00:14:37.028
zašto nećete uspjeti

00:14:37.028 --> 00:14:39.257
imati veliku karijeru.

00:14:41.407 --> 00:14:42.643
osim ako ...

00:14:46.893 --> 00:14:47.901
Osim ako.

00:14:50.071 --> 00:14:54.001
Hvala vam (Pljesak)